scribed in 1984.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/4731895193928612585'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/4731895193928612585'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html?showComment=1441392081404#c4731895193928612585' title=''/><author><name>Handy Brothers</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15061612522344257078</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fd8twcrjl4c/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAFI/wLhowPHwmFI/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6747260241054940615' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6747260241054940615' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-679148324"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2015 at 12:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2262736880948121380</id><published>2015-07-07T15:42:19.678-06:00</published><updated>2015-07-07T15:42:19.678-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Where two or more are gathered in my name, i am th...</title><content type='html'>Where two or more are gathered in my name, i am there.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That is the &amp;quot;church&amp;quot;! &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Look into house churches. That seems to be on pointe.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/2262736880948121380'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/2262736880948121380'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html?showComment=1436305339678#c2262736880948121380' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/7035397841604983422'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6747260241054940615' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6747260241054940615' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-326991482"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 7, 2015 at 3:42 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7035397841604983422</id><published>2015-07-04T14:55:47.754-06:00</published><updated>2015-07-04T14:55:47.754-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Linda June&#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;The power to tax is the power to...</title><content type='html'>Linda June&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;The power to tax is the power to destroy, and withdrawing the exemption would effectively extinguish religious liberty by replacing it with a revocable state-issued license.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But Will, didn&amp;#39;t that already happen?  Aren&amp;#39;t we witnessing the end results now?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The funny thing is, when the churches in this country decided to forfeit their supra-governmental status and become government-created corporations, this very result became inevitable.  What the state creates, it controls and, ultimately, destroys.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;When churches were not ever liable to the federal income tax, just as the state citizens were and are not liable, the church authorities did the most curious thing:  they agreed to be liable and then sought special exemption.  What?  Why?  The hypocrisy is astounding.  They were telling their flocks that they had to pay income tax on top of tithes, but the church itself would be above such an atrocity as the tax.  Were all the men of the church fools?  Cowards?  Unwilling to refuse the pressure to be taxed when they had every legal and lawful right not to be?  Why did they not (why don&amp;#39;t they now) instruct their flocks in the laws that prove no state citizen has an obligation to pay an income tax to the federal government even as they themselves did not?  Why did they lust after 501c3 corporations?  What did they need them for?  What kind of sorcery seduced their minds, inflamed their lust for lucre?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I want so much to give the men of the church the benefit of the doubt and think they were just naifs, that they did not know they were opening the sheep gates wide and inviting the wolves in to feast.  But how can I, a barely-educated peasant, know that by accepting a state-created identity they had sold their soul to the Devil but not the educated men of faith?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Only time will tell how many men of the church will repent and defend the Bride of Christ and how many will continue to grovel at their master&amp;#39;s feet while the true faithful disappear below ground and, with all their brethren around the world, continue to worship at The Master&amp;#39;s feet.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/7035397841604983422'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/7035397841604983422'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html?showComment=1436043347754#c7035397841604983422' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6747260241054940615' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6747260241054940615' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-371748653"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 4, 2015 at 2:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4922200516877745822</id><published>2015-07-04T14:54:47.543-06:00</published><updated>2015-07-04T14:54:47.543-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;The power to tax is the power to destroy, an...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;The power to tax is the power to destroy, and withdrawing the exemption would effectively extinguish religious liberty by replacing it with a revocable state-issued license.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But Will, didn&amp;#39;t that already happen?  Aren&amp;#39;t we witnessing the end results now?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The funny thing is, when the churches in this country decided to forfeit their supra-governmental status and become government-created corporations, this very result became inevitable.  What the state creates, it controls and, ultimately, destroys.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;When churches were not ever liable to the federal income tax, just as the state citizens were and are not liable, the church authorities did the most curious thing:  they agreed to be liable and then sought special exemption.  What?  Why?  The hypocrisy is astounding.  They were telling their flocks that they had to pay income tax on top of tithes, but the church itself would be above such an atrocity as the tax.  Were all the men of the church fools?  Cowards?  Unwilling to refuse the pressure to be taxed when they had every legal and lawful right not to be?  Why did they not (why don&amp;#39;t they now) instruct their flocks in the laws that prove no state citizen has an obligation to pay an income tax to the federal government even as they themselves did not?  Why did they lust after 501c3 corporations?  What did they need them for?  What kind of sorcery seduced their minds, inflamed their lust for lucre?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I want so much to give the men of the church the benefit of the doubt and think they were just naifs, that they did not know they were opening the sheep gates wide and inviting the wolves in to feast.  But how can I, a barely-educated peasant, know that by accepting a state-created identity they had sold their soul to the Devil but not the educated men of faith?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Only time will tell how many men of the church will repent and defend the Bride of Christ and how many will continue to grovel at their master&amp;#39;s feet while the true faithful disappear below ground and, with all their brethren around the world, continue to worship at The Master&amp;#39;s feet.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/4922200516877745822'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/4922200516877745822'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html?showComment=1436043287543#c4922200516877745822' title=''/><author><name>Linda June</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6747260241054940615' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6747260241054940615' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-371748653"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 4, 2015 at 2:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1593339657667052753</id><published>2015-06-30T18:59:02.259-06:00</published><updated>2015-06-30T18:59:02.259-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I had always assumed the next civil war would be f...</title><content type='html'>I had always assumed the next civil war would be fought over infringements of the second amendment alone. It now appears it will be fought over the regime&amp;#39;s war on all civil rights. The speed of its arrival will depend on how quickly the regime renews it&amp;#39;s efforts against gun rights. Once millions of us no longer feel there is anything left to lose, the war will begin.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/1593339657667052753'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/1593339657667052753'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html?showComment=1435712342259#c1593339657667052753' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='ht