was arguing that same-sex couples have a constitutional right to marry) if the Bob Jones University ruling would result in the loss of tax-exempt status of any religious school that opposed same-sex marriage. The Solicitor General responded, ‘it’s certainly going to be an issue.’”</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/8802075459493169622'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6747260241054940615/comments/default/8802075459493169622'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html?showComment=1435683009523#c8802075459493169622' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/love-of-power-wins-now-yezhovschina-can.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6747260241054940615' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6747260241054940615' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-841179678"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 30, 2015 at 10:50 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8546827121313543498</id><published>2015-06-30T07:48:17.750-06:00</published><updated>2015-06-30T07:48:17.750-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Strength is misspelled in the Ministry of Love ico...</title><content type='html'>Strength is misspelled in the Ministry of Love icon.&lt;br /&gt;Excellent as always, Will. &lt;br /&gt;Does anyone else think that photo of Dylann Roof with the guards looks staged like right out of a movie?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/a